Note: DAW authoring API v1. Import exposes helpers; it never starts generation or writes MIDI.
use "@std"

Note: Return a named score layer directly from the descriptor's entry procedure.
Note: More layers can be added with the standard immutable dict set/merge operations.
internal proc dawResult (Song: song)
internal proc dawResult (String: layer, Song: song)

Note: Immutable versioned audio graph authoring; no device opens during construction.
internal proc dawInput (String: id, Int: bus)
internal proc dawDevice (String: id, String: device, Int: version, AudioGraph: input, Dict<String, Double>: parameters, Bool: bypass)
internal proc dawGain (String: id, AudioGraph: input, Double: gain)
internal proc dawPan (String: id, AudioGraph: input, Double: pan)
internal proc dawDrive (String: id, AudioGraph: input, Double: drive)
internal proc dawMix (String: id, AudioGraph: left, AudioGraph: right)
internal proc dawSum (String: id, AudioGraphs: inputs)

Note: Offline buffer preview uses the same prepared kernels as live processing.
internal proc dawProcess (AudioGraph: graph, Buffer: input)
internal proc dawProcess (AudioGraph: graph, Buffers: inputs)

Note: Version-1 tuned-note sine instrument. Voice/envelope edits require preparation.
internal proc dawSine (Int: voices, Millisecond: attack, Millisecond: release)

Note: Copies a rendered/processed stereo buffer into an immutable audio source.
internal proc dawAudio (Buffer: buffer)
Note: Source-frame gain envelope; frame values are strings for exact 64-bit identity.
internal proc dawClipEnvelope (DawClip: clip, Double: gain, String: startFrame, String: lengthFrames, String: fadeInFrames, String: fadeOutFrames)

Note: Named heterogeneous results; duplicate names within a role are rejected.
internal proc dawResult (String: layer, DawAudio: audio)
internal proc dawResult (String: layer, AudioGraph: graph)
internal proc dawResult (String: layer, DawInstrument: instrument)
internal proc dawCombine (DawResult: left, DawResult: right)
internal proc dawCombine (Dict<String, Song>: left, DawResult: right)
internal proc dawCombine (DawResult: left, Dict<String, Song>: right)
internal proc dawCombine (Dict<String, Song>: left, Dict<String, Song>: right)

Note: Finite delay with 1–16 echoes; time/repeat edits require preparation. Wet and feedback ramp.
internal proc dawDelay (String: id, AudioGraph: input, Millisecond: time, Int: repeats, Double: feedback, Double: wet)

Note: One-shot stereo sampler; rootHz is the recorded pitch. Linear interpolation; no loop.
internal proc dawSampler (DawAudio: sample, Double: rootHz, Int: voices, Millisecond: attack, Millisecond: release)

Note: Musical automation with stable lane/graph IDs and quarter-to-value points. True means linear.
internal proc dawCurve (String: id, String: graphBinding, String: node, String: parameter, Dict<Double, Double>: points, Bool: linear)
Note: Preview explicit curves against a quarter-to-BPM map through the same project lowering path.
internal proc dawProcess (AudioGraph: graph, Buffer: input, DawAutomations: curves, Dict<Double, Double>: tempoMap)
internal proc dawProcess (AudioGraph: graph, Buffers: inputs, DawAutomations: curves, Dict<Double, Double>: tempoMap)

Note: Restore detached project resources without executing saved code or opening asset files.
internal proc dawProjectSnapshot (String: snapshot)
Note: Captured build context. Info strings preserve exact 64-bit revisions/budget ticks. Tempo keys are quarters; meter keys are one-based bars.
internal proc dawContextInfo ()
Note: Resolve captured host PCM by project asset identity, never a file path.
internal proc dawAssetSample (String: assetId)
internal proc dawTempoMap ()
internal proc dawMeterNumerators ()
internal proc dawMeterDenominators ()
Note: Portable offline export defaults; hardware sessions still use their negotiated format.
internal proc dawRenderSettings (DawProject: project, Int: sampleRate, Int: blockFrames)
Note: Persist the selected project sample identities for an ordinary generator's future builds.
internal proc dawAssetGrants (DawProject: project, String: sourceId, Strings: assetIds)
Note: Captured tuning text, not paths. Empty Scala/keyboardMap selects the named system; accepted notes change only on explicit regeneration.
internal proc dawProjectTuning (DawProject: project, String: system, String: key, String: scala, String: keyboardMap)
internal proc dawPlaceScore (DawProject: project, String: id, String: track, String: source, String: layer, Double: anchor, Double: offset, Double: length, Double: nudgeMs)
Note: Audio source offsets/lengths use decimal strings for exact 64-bit frame counts.
internal proc dawPlaceAudio (DawProject: project, String: id, String: track, String: source, Double: anchor, String: offsetFrames, String: lengthFrames, Int: sampleRate, Double: nudgeMs)

Note: Detached clips and one-pass arrangement construction. dawArrange replaces the clip list.
internal proc dawScoreClip (String: id, String: track, String: source, String: layer, Double: anchor, Double: offset, Double: length, Double: nudgeMs)
internal proc dawAudioClip (String: id, String: track, String: source, Double: anchor, String: offsetFrames, String: lengthFrames, Int: sampleRate, Double: nudgeMs)
internal proc dawArrange (DawProject: project, DawClips: clips)
internal proc dawRelativeOffsetMs (DawClip: clip, Double: offsetMs)
Note: Prefer typed time; the Double overload is retained for existing generated code.
internal proc dawRelativeOffsetMs (DawClip: clip, Millisecond: offset)
internal proc dawRelativeOffsetMs (DawClip: clip, Second: offset)
internal proc dawSetOffsetMs (DawClip: clip, Millisecond: offset)
internal proc dawSetOffsetMs (DawClip: clip, Second: offset)
Note: Step tempo keyed by quarters; meter numerator/denominator maps share one-based bar keys. Clip windows and nudge are preserved.
internal proc dawProjectTiming (DawProject: project, Dict<Double, Double>: tempo, Dict<Int, Int>: numerators, Dict<Int, Int>: denominators)
internal proc dawAlignToBar (DawProject: project, DawClip: clip, Int: bar)
internal proc dawSplitScore (DawClip: clip, Double: localQuarter, String: rightId)
internal proc dawSplitAudio (DawProject: project, DawClip: clip, String: localFrame, String: rightId)
Note: Trim moves the left edge by a signed source delta and sets the new length, preserving surviving event times and nudge.
internal proc dawTrimScore (DawClip: clip, Double: startDeltaQuarters, Double: lengthQuarters)
internal proc dawTrimAudio (DawProject: project, DawClip: clip, String: startDeltaFrames, String: lengthFrames)
Note: Repeat returns additional linked copies, excluding the original, with caller-supplied distinct IDs. Audio repeats use sample duration through the tempo map.
internal proc dawRepeatScore (DawClip: clip, Strings: copyIds)
internal proc dawRepeatAudio (DawProject: project, DawClip: clip, Strings: copyIds)
Note: Reconstruct a named project graph output with explicit shared device definitions.
internal proc dawProjectGraph (DawProject: project, String: sourceId, String: layer, AudioGraph: graph)
internal proc dawProjectCurves (DawProject: project, DawAutomations: curves)
internal proc dawTrack (String: id, String: name, String: instrumentBinding)
internal proc dawTrack (String: id, String: name, String: instrumentBinding, Int: inputBus)
Note: Muted tracks remain silent even when soloed; multiple solo tracks are audible together. State gates track output after inserts.
internal proc dawTrack (String: id, String: name, String: instrumentBinding, Int: inputBus, Bool: muted, Bool: solo)
Note: Opaque sRGB color encoded as an integer R*65536+G*256+B; -1 selects automatic frontend color.
internal proc dawTrackColor (DawTrack: track, Int: rgb)
internal proc dawRouting (DawProject: project, DawTracks: tracks, String: graphBinding)
internal proc dawRouting (DawProject: project, String: graphBinding)
internal proc dawInsertEffect (DawProject: project, String: trackId, String: effectBinding, Bool: bypassed)
internal proc dawProjectInstrument (DawProject: project, String: sourceId, String: layer, DawInstrument: instrument)
internal proc dawProjectSample (DawProject: project, String: sourceId, String: layer)
Note: Detached authored event; empty letter and zero Hz represent a rest. Rational/origin are optional metadata strings.
internal proc dawNote (String: noteId, String: voiceId, Double: offsetQuarters, Double: durationQuarters, String: pitchLetter, Int: pitchOctave, Int: pitchAlteration, String: centText, Int: midiKey, Double: frequencyHz, Double: noteVelocity, Int: noteArticulation, Bool: isTied, Double: overlapQuarters, Double: portamentoMilliseconds, String: rationalText, String: originText)
internal proc dawProjectNotes (DawProject: project, String: sourceId, String: layer, String: sectionId, String: sequenceId, DawNotes: notes)

Note: Composable stereo sample streams. Value nodes are smoothed/automatable parameter signals.
internal proc dawValue (String: id, Double: value)
internal proc dawMultiply (String: id, AudioGraph: left, AudioGraph: right)
internal proc dawTanh (String: id, AudioGraph: input)

Note: Per-channel Hz streams drive oscillator frequency and one-pole filter cutoff.
internal proc dawSineOsc (String: id, AudioGraph: frequency)
internal proc dawLowPass (String: id, AudioGraph: input, AudioGraph: cutoff)

Note: Linear gate-driven envelope. Timing/settings edits require graph preparation.
internal proc dawAdsr (String: id, AudioGraph: gate, Millisecond: attack, Millisecond: decay, Double: sustain, Millisecond: release)

Note: Per-voice graph buses: 0 pitch Hz, 1 gate, 2 velocity. Graph owns its envelope.
internal proc dawGraphInstrument (AudioGraph: graph, Int: voices)

Note: Edge-corrected saw and fixed 50-percent square; frequency input in Hz.
internal proc dawSawOsc (String: id, AudioGraph: frequency)
internal proc dawSquareOsc (String: id, AudioGraph: frequency)

Note: Public plugin parameter curve in project musical time.
internal proc dawPluginCurve (String: id, String: binding, String: parameter, Dict<Double, Double>: points, Bool: linear)

Note: Gate-triggered one-shot stereo samples; slot bindings are immutable instrument assets.
internal proc dawSample (String: id, AudioGraph: frequency, AudioGraph: gate, Int: asset, Double: rootHz)
internal proc dawSampleInstrument (AudioGraph: graph, Int: voices, Dict<Int, DawAudio>: samples)
internal proc dawProjectGraphSample (DawProject: project, String: source, String: layer, Int: slot)

Note: Decode a hash-pinned WAVE dependency by ID during a declared plugin build only.
internal proc dawPluginSample (String: dependency)

Note: Detached note windows for input-consuming processors; no MIDI file is written.
internal proc dawResult (String: layer, DawNoteSequence: notes)
internal proc dawNoteSequence (DawNotes: notes, Double: durationQuarters)
internal proc dawNotes (DawNoteSequence: input)
internal proc dawNoteDuration (DawNoteSequence: input)
internal proc dawTransposeNotes (DawNoteSequence: input, Int: semitones)
internal proc dawNoteVelocity (DawNote: note)
internal proc dawNoteVelocity (DawNote: note, Double: velocity)
